          "id": "64f615b5-7b39-460b-98cd-508fd8833a65",
          "memory": "On Sunday, September 27, 2026, User spent the day in blanket mode on the couch and finally folded laundry that morning, while Maya said her laundry was judging her from the corner and last week's chair pile had become permanent decor.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f8b7b984-820a-49ef-a031-34ceaca3f819",
          "memory": "As of September 27, 2026, Maya's grocery-store basil was still alive somehow, which she called a miracle, and User said their own plants were doing better since actually watering them in a plant parent redemption arc.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "434e763a-64b0-4849-8c7a-911edc344d3f",
          "memory": "On Sunday, September 27, 2026, Maya spent the day doing literally nothing with scrolling, a nap, and pasta leftovers, while User had cereal for lunch, which Maya called a classic Sunday meal.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "c6da9a0e-3af1-44ee-b67c-ef7f3574c3f0",
          "memory": "Around September 27, 2026, Maya spotted a new pizza place near the station that opened about a week earlier with oven in the name, noting a busy line, and she and User discussed trying it someday when over there while affirming Rosa's with its garlic knots still has their hearts.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "bf694fb9-0b86-4477-b38e-2606134939ec",
          "memory": "As of September 27, 2026, Maya's sister still had not signed up for pottery despite saying she will, with User joking the Tuesday instructor is waiting.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "adcdb72c-164b-4951-a50c-ad6651d2be35",
          "memory": "User's wavy pottery bowl is holding keys as functional art as of September 27, 2026, which Maya loved.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e4d82614-ee90-4f56-beee-a124471784f4",
          "memory": "On Sunday evening, September 27, 2026, Maya was rotting on the couch watching a random chaotic baking show and might do a face mask later, promising to send the show name after the episode, while User skipped a second laundry round because couch wins on Sundays.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
